CD\">\n<p>This item can only be equipped by <a href=\"/page/Pet\" title=\"Pet\">Pets</a>. As it does not specifically exclude Iron Defenders like most armor, it can be equipped by both Wolves and Iron Defenders, even though Iron Defenders can usually only equip Docents.\n</p><p>(This item does not affect your pet's cosmetic appearance.)\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817212955\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.093 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.147 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4019/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30243/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9329/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n104.22%  133.352     54 Template:IO\n100.00%  127.946      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  127.946      1 -total\n 97.78%  125.112      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 34.91%   44.660      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 34.25%   43.817      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 33.08%   42.329      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 32.29%   41.308      2 Template:InCategory\n 24.11%   30.843      9 Template:Popup\n 13.20%   16.889      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:83333-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817212955 and revision id 644158. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
